<style>
  .page-hero { background: var(--blush); padding: 56px 40px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .page-hero p.eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .page-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); font-weight: 300; }
  .page-hero h1 em { font-style: italic; }
  .page-content { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 40px 80px; }
  .page-content > p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .section-title { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--charcoal); margin: 56px 0 20px; }
  .shipping-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .shipping-table th { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; color: var(--mid-grey); text-align: left; padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--blush); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .shipping-table td { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); padding: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); vertical-align: top; }
  .shipping-table td:first-child { color: var(--charcoal); font-weight: 400; }
  .shipping-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .shipping-table tr:hover td { background: var(--cream); }
  .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 3px 8px; background: var(--gold); color: var(--white); font-weight: 500; margin-left: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }
  .policy-card { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 28px 32px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .policy-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .policy-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .policy-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .policy-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .policy-card ul li { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; padding: 6px 0 6px 20px; position: relative; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--blush); }
  .policy-card ul li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .policy-card ul li::before { content: '—'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gold); }
  .highlight-box { background: var(--blush); padding: 24px 28px; margin: 32px 0; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); }
  .highlight-box p { margin: 0; color: var(--charcoal); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .contact-cta { background: var(--charcoal); color: var(--white); padding: 48px 40px; text-align: center; margin-top: 64px; }
  .contact-cta h3 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .contact-cta p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .contact-cta a { display: inline-block; padding: 13px 40px; border: 1px solid var(--white); color: var(--white); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .contact-cta a:hover { background: var(--white); color: var(--charcoal); }
  @media (max-width: 768px) { .page-content { padding: 40px 20px 60px; } .shipping-table th, .shipping-table td { padding: 12px; } }
</style>

<div class="page-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Melia Nae</p>
  <h1>Shipping <em>Information</em></h1>
</div>

<div class="page-content">
  <p>We want your Melia Nae pieces to reach you safely and swiftly. All orders are shipped via <strong>Australia Post</strong> and carefully packaged to ensure your jewellery arrives in perfect condition.</p>

  <h2 class="section-title">Domestic Shipping (Australia)</h2>
  <table class="shipping-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Estimated Delivery</th><th>Cost</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Standard Shipping</td><td>3–7 business days</td><td>Calculated at checkout</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Express Shipping</td><td>1–3 business days</td><td>Calculated at checkout</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Free Standard Shipping <span class="tag">Free</span></td><td>3–7 business days</td><td>On orders over $150 AUD</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="highlight-box"><p><strong>Free shipping</strong> is automatically applied at checkout on all Australian orders over $150 AUD. No code needed.</p></div>

  <h2 class="section-title">International Shipping</h2>
  <table class="shipping-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Region</th><th>Estimated Delivery</th><th>Cost</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>New Zealand</td><td>5–10 business days</td><td>Calculated at checkout</td></tr>
      <tr><td>United States &amp; Canada</td><td>10–20 business days</td><td>Calculated at checkout</td></tr>
      <tr><td>United Kingdom &amp; Europe</td><td>10–20 business days</td><td>Calculated at checkout</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Rest of World</td><td>14–28 business days</td><td>Calculated at checkout</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 class="section-title">How We Ship</h2>

  <div class="policy-card">
    <h3>📦 Packaging</h3>
    <p>Every Melia Nae order arrives in our signature gift box — beautifully presented and ready to give. We use discreet outer packaging so there's no indication of the contents.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="policy-card">
    <h3>🔍 Order Tracking</h3>
    <p>Once your order is dispatched, you'll receive a shipping confirmation email with your Australia Post tracking number.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Tracking emails are sent within 24 hours of dispatch</li>
      <li>Check your junk/spam folder if you don't receive it</li>
      <li>Contact us if you haven't received tracking details after 3 business days</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="policy-card">
    <h3>⏱️ Processing Times</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Standard jewellery: 1–2 business days to dispatch</li>
      <li>Engraved or personalised pieces: 3–5 business days to dispatch</li>
      <li>Custom orders: timeframe confirmed at time of order</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="policy-card">
    <h3>🌍 Customs &amp; Import Duties</h3>
    <p>For international orders, your parcel may be subject to customs inspection and import duties levied by your country's customs authority. These charges are the responsibility of the recipient and are not included in our shipping rates.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="contact-cta">
  <h3>Questions About Your Order?</h3>
  <p>Our team is happy to help with tracking, delivery queries or anything else.</p>
  <a href="/pages/contact">Get in Touch</a>
</div>
